# Build contexts for web+gateway are the repo root (compose `context: ..`).
# Keep them small and secret-free: nothing below is COPYed into any image,
# but everything here would otherwise ship to the daemon on every build
# (including .git history and infra/.env dev keys) and bloat transfer time.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
data/
docs/
repo-media/
infra/.env
infra/workspaces/
infra/data/
apps/web/.env*
apps/gateway/.env*
*.log
.DS_Store
